Teach 2,247,600,000 berries

167
00:10:56,480 --> 00:11:01,140
As for the next bounty, this man has
been an emperor for six years now.

168
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:06,337
He's the youngest of the four and
deeply admired by his subordinates,

169
00:11:06,420 --> 00:11:08,302
whom you probably have heard of.

170
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,400
Beckman, Rue, Yasopp.

171
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:15,217
Each with a high average
bounty themselves.

172
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:19,557
This pirate crew is world-renowned for
having an excellent balance of skills.

173
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:22,169
There really are no
weaklings amongst them.

174
00:11:23,460 --> 00:11:25,860
The chief of the Red-Hair Pirates,

175
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:31,980
Red-Hair Shakes, he's set
at 4,048,900,000 berries!

176
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,200
Now, let's move on.

177
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:41,237
She was born a monster who
allegedly destroyed an entire

178
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:44,660
village of giants in Elbath
when she was just a child.

179
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:48,600
If you're not one of her 85 children,

180
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:52,958
or at least related by blood, you
will naturally be mistrusted by her.

181
00:11:53,140 --> 00:11:58,081
She's the undisputed queen of the sweet-themed
network of islands known as Totoland.

182
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:04,200
That is, of course, the captain of the
Big Mom Pirates, Charlotte Lin-Lin.

183
00:12:04,460 --> 00:12:07,900
She's worth 4,388,000,000 berries.

184
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:17,100
Finally, we have a monster who made
a name for himself early on in life.

185
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:21,506
This man was only an apprentice
when he joined the Rock's crew.

186
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:25,037
He won the respect of the most ferocious

187
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:27,617
of pirates through his
sheer strength alone,

188
00:12:27,700 --> 00:12:31,460
until he was worthy of earning
the title Emperor of the Sea.

189
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:37,080
Supreme Commander of
the Beast Pirates Kaido,

190
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:42,920
King of the Beasts Worth
4,611,100,000 Berries

191
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:52,397
How distressing Now it goes without
saying But they decided at the

192
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:56,540
reverie That we will no longer
have the Warlords at our disposal

193
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:06,737
only time will tell if distancing ourselves
was a good decision or not we'll have

194
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:08,457
to wait and see how the navy's special

195
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:12,057
science team the ssg
performs since we're here

196
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:15,197
i'll put this in perspective i might as

197
00:13:15,280 --> 00:13:17,197
well share the bounties
of some other legends

198
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:21,937
the captain of the white beard pirates

199
00:13:22,020 --> 00:13:27,360
edward newgate 5 billion
46 million berries

200
00:13:31,980 --> 00:13:35,597
The captain of the Roger
Pirates The king of the

201
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:41,620
pirates Gold Roger 5 billion
564 million 800 thousand

202
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:50,900
There hasn't been a bounty to
surpass these two At least not yet

203
00:13:54,260 --> 00:13:57,060
But if Big Mom and Kaido
form their alliance,

204
00:13:57,380 --> 00:14:00,457
their combined bounty will be the
highest the world has ever seen,

205
00:14:00,540 --> 00:14:02,893
and the size of their crew will be huge.

206
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,734
I've read the reports.

207
00:14:06,940 --> 00:14:09,175
This is happening as we speak in Wano.

208
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:12,580
Fleet Admiral Sakazuki.

209
00:14:12,860 --> 00:14:15,154
We won't be getting involved with that.

210
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:19,460
In case you went senile,

211
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:23,057
we lack the manpower and resources
to handle this currently.

212
00:14:23,140 --> 00:14:24,260
Any questions?

213
00:14:32,180 --> 00:14:33,010
None.

214
00:14:33,140 --> 00:14:35,493
I never intended to get involved anyway.

215
00:14:35,940 --> 00:14:38,077
This old man was simply
providing these young

216
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:40,572
soldiers with some wisdom and experience.

217
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:48,677
At the end of the day, pirates are humans.

218
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:51,466
They have their own
relationships and reasons.

219
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:54,699
You can't take action without
knowing their history.

220
00:14:55,660 --> 00:15:00,220
Speaking of which, there was a pirate
from Wano who Whitebeard was fond of.

221
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:02,536
He was favored by Roger and Red Hair.

222
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:10,020
You mean Kozuki Odin, don't you?

223
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:13,837
The man who served as a commander
on Whitebeard's ship long ago.

224
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:15,800
None other, of course.

225
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,649
And that's not all he did.

226
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:21,409
The King of the Pirates recruited
him for his final journey.

227
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:23,197
Something's not adding up.

228
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:26,633
While I can't imagine Odin
being connected, it seems odd.

229
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:34,817
Doesn't it make you question
why all these huge players have

230
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:38,540
such close ties to an isolated
country like the land of Wano?

231
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:45,300
I can't believe it's coincidence.

232
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:48,840
You do well to keep your
eyes open, Sakazuki.
